{
  "id": "80656",
  "type": "Page",
  "tags": [],
  "title": "How to Use the OLI Course ",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "This course applies research-based learning science principles to guide and support you as you learn general chemistry. Each element—learning objectives, content, activities, and more—is designed to help you successfully and efficiently learn the concepts of chemistry."
              }
            ],
            "id": "m7p30hss5w86ned",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "cy1mh11ta69gyeo",
                "text": "Learning Objectives"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ujto28xymlhaivo",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "At the top of every core content page is one or more learning objectives."
              }
            ],
            "id": "0e7bm5qnufh4hel",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Learning objectives appear at the top of the page to guide your learning."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "466rdakplsutu9m",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5qxytvnu9fcyknp",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "ch8eqgbimzd9m9x",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "display": "block",
                "id": "3324317547",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/AE/AEA31DA044FA5C717D0DA20A239DA5F3/objective.jpg",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "5amyf0k6l0wiiu0",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Learning objectives tell you what you should aim to accomplish on that page. Make a mental note of each objective or write it down and think about it as you go through the content. Ask yourself, “Am I achieving this objective?” "
              }
            ],
            "id": "u745x16ibihz8x2",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "yl0tbyzdi0braib",
                "text": "Activities"
              }
            ],
            "id": "gsjnpersaze6lnj",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "This course has two types of activities: "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              },
              {
                "text": " and "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Did I Get This?"
              },
              {
                "text": " Each is designed for a unique purpose, and both help you to engage in the learning process and think more deeply about the content you have read.  "
              }
            ],
            "id": "vwo88y30zgbzllq",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "zgyz83pxtifcx4f",
                "text": "Learn By Doing"
              }
            ],
            "id": "10yn8wcxhmr4g0e",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Learn By Doing activities are designed to "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "scaffold"
                  }
                ],
                "content": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Scaffolding breaks down information into chunks; once you are proficient with a chunk, you can build on it by adding the next chunk. "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "1708597305",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1974071733",
                "trigger": "hover",
                "type": "popup"
              },
              {
                "text": " your learning. They present problems in a step-by-step manner that guides you through the process of solving the problem. Many Learn By Doing activities also offer one or more hints. If you need help with a problem, click "
              },
              {
                "strong": true,
                "text": "Request Hint"
              },
              {
                "text": ". "
              }
            ],
            "id": "6grhuidluh1bwmr",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Learn By Doing activities scaffold practice. Ask for a hint if you are unsure how to proceed. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "022rrx0s92d2l90",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "q9tfr76oadrtp66",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "znijp5dp8tfy22s",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "display": "block",
                "id": "1642986012",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/05/0531DA41C8D907E878A7D1C211F83590/LBDimage.jpg",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "jzdd7oapkprv8o5",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Some Learn By Doing activities present problem solving in a step-by-step manner to scaffold practice. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "vy5pj3qsnkfcsvp",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "io297hn68k84vwj",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "dpju9lcd7ioah4k",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "display": "block",
                "id": "3446454624",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/3E/3ED271DB4EDAAA3D3B4A18AE2AD94E86/LBDimage2.jpg",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "bupu1ry5218yetz",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "allmliraevp5sjo",
                "text": "Did I Get This?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "7yd31up85wur16r",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Each Did I Get This? activity is designed to be a self-assessment. Generally, the activities do not include hints and are not presented in a stepwise manner. Did I Get This? activities give you the opportunity to determine whether you “got” the concept. If you feel you do not fully understand the concept, go back and review the previous material and/or seek help from your instructor.  "
              }
            ],
            "id": "i2sv4yvcj72jxmo",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Did I Get This? activities allow you to self-assess your understanding before a graded assignment. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "okar0m1lmuinn37",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "6q2lwosxzra22y1",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "wbducqg1hf0h8zi",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "display": "block",
                "id": "3756482138",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/F8/F8DF17C18F27FAA06CF9D1CE2244016A/DIGT.jpg",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ujzi8f0fz66d926",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "srxkhsqw2p05e2k",
                "text": "Key Equations and Key Terms"
              }
            ],
            "id": "1358979282",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "At the end of each unit is a Key Equations and Key Terms page. Consider keeping this page open in a separate tab as you proceed through the unit so that you can refer to it easily. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "3961738868",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Equations are essential to explaining the properties, behaviors, and interactions of matter. Reviewing the key equations—before you start and after you complete each unit—reinforces the concepts you learn in each unit."
              }
            ],
            "id": "433814867",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "You'll encounter many new terms in your study of chemistry. To understand chemistry, you must understand the words that describe it. This course supports you in multiple ways as you learn new terms: "
              }
            ],
            "id": "2354920064",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Terms are listed on the Key Equations and Key Terms pages."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "608029486",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "994854422",
                "type": "li"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Terms are used directly in the text, where the context of the discussion helps you to infer their meaning."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "2171295045",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "942189197",
                "type": "li"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Terms are defined in rollovers, which appear in blue, bold-italic text, like this: "
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "text": "rollover"
                          }
                        ],
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "text": "Text or image on a web page that provides relevant information in a pop-up window when users hover their mouse over it."
                              }
                            ],
                            "id": "1747716804",
                            "type": "p"
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "1915703134",
                        "trigger": "hover",
                        "type": "popup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ". When you hover your cursor over the term, its definition pops up.  "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "1777127707",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "4044138463",
                "type": "li"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "A glossary provides a quick, convenient way to look up terms as needed, so you might wish to keep it open in a separate tab. "
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "cdvkgre6wcet1em",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1478027119",
                "type": "li"
              }
            ],
            "id": "342415832",
            "type": "ul"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "aswc19jqjzuzn0e",
                "text": "End of Module Activities"
              }
            ],
            "id": "sgqd7g3kco2jevq",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "n5jvbotut51t0ei",
                "text": "My Response"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ozkdc2d6mrbk7cc",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "My Response"
              },
              {
                "text": " activity links are included at the end of each module. Use these activities to reflect on how well you learned the concepts presented. Reflecting on your own learning, also known as "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "metacognition,"
              },
              {
                "text": " is a proven way to promote the development of effective learning."
              }
            ],
            "id": "319292018",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "At the end of each module, you can also include questions you might have for your instructor. Your responses are sent to your instructor and may be used in classroom discussions."
              }
            ],
            "id": "8wlhwdfm33f5ljf",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Click on the My Response link to reflect on your understanding and provide feedback to your instructor. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "6zbz5nc7g6enfby",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "nmtt5y5vupgvvm6",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "7hro4d3rhllnc0t",
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "display": "block",
                "id": "3778490603",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/8B/8B39D24C6536000857489214A55CDECA/myresponse.jpg",
                "type": "img"
              }
            ],
            "id": "6kvvfrraxivz29u",
            "type": "callout"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "yxxgzn8x042rfry",
                "text": "Checkpoints"
              }
            ],
            "id": "vkd8kw8b2ubhxhq",
            "type": "h2"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Each module and unit ends with a "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "Checkpoint."
              },
              {
                "text": " This is a graded assignment, and the score is reported to your instructor. Your instructor may decide to assign points to your overall grade in the course for these assignments. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "qzkp3k3dtouzvcq",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "id": "etwwz0dsrfcce8d",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "178x1zrkio9m5td",
                "text": ""
              }
            ],
            "display": "block",
            "id": "1115673675",
            "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/86/8653065E749223B413FA1F739818EF9E/checkpoint.jpg",
            "type": "img"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "cwz8hlzypylpvjy",
                "text": "Entering Scientific Notation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "ydlbp0hmg2quoom",
            "type": "h1"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "This course has many numeric input problems. You may use standard notation or scientific notation. Scientific notation is highly recommended for very small or very large values."
              }
            ],
            "id": "2788514945",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "For exponents, use the letter "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "e."
              },
              {
                "text": " For example, for 6.022 × 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "23"
              },
              {
                "text": ", enter 6.022e23. "
              }
            ],
            "id": "s34vojackygxo8p",
            "type": "p"
          }
        ],
